function quizTimeLimitSeconds(count){if(activeQuiz&&/^120 Rules · Part [1-4]/.test(activeQuiz.title))return 60*60;if(count<=10)return 5*60;if(count<=30)return 15*60;if(count<=90)return 30*60;return 60*60}
function formatQuizTime(seconds){const s=Math.max(0,seconds|0);return `${String(Math.floor(s/60)).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(s%60).padStart(2,'0')}`}
function stopQuizTimer(){if(quizTimerInterval){clearInterval(quizTimerInterval);quizTimerInterval=null}}
function startQuizTimer(){stopQuizTimer();quizSubmitted=false;quizDeadline=Date.now()+quizTimeLimitSeconds(activeQuiz.questions.length)*1000;quizTimerInterval=setInterval(()=>{const remaining=Math.ceil((quizDeadline-Date.now())/1000);const el=$('#quizTimer');if(el){el.textContent=formatQuizTime(remaining);el.classList.toggle('timer-warning',remaining<=60)}if(remaining<=0){stopQuizTimer();finishQuiz(true)}},250)}
function startQuiz(key){if(/^grammar120part[1-4]$/.test(key)){activeQuiz=buildGrammarPartQuiz(Number(key.slice(-1)));currentQuestion=0;quizScore=0;picked=false;startQuizTimer();renderQuestion();return}activeQuiz=quizzes[key];currentQuestion=0;quizScore=0;picked=false;startQuizTimer();renderQuestion()}
function renderQuestion(){
 const q=activeQuiz.questions[currentQuestion];
 const remaining=Math.ceil((quizDeadline-Date.now())/1000);
 showModal(`<div class="eyebrow">PRACTICE SESSION · ${activeQuiz.title.toUpperCase()}</div><div class="quiz-heading-row"><h2 id="modalTitle">${activeQuiz.title}</h2><div class="quiz-timer-wrap"><span>TIME LEFT</span><strong id="quizTimer">${formatQuizTime(remaining)}</strong></div></div><div class="quiz-progress"><span style="width:${(currentQuestion/activeQuiz.questions.length)*100}%"></span></div><p>Question ${currentQuestion+1} of ${activeQuiz.questions.length}</p><h3 style="font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;margin:15px 0">${q.q}</h3><div id="options">${q.options.map((o,i)=>`<button class="quiz-option" data-answer="${i}">${String.fromCharCode(65+i)}. ${o}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="feedback"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="nextQuestion" disabled style="width:100%">${currentQuestion===activeQuiz.questions.length-1?'See results':'Next question'} →</button>`);
 $$('#options .quiz-option').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>chooseAnswer(Number(b.dataset.answer))));
 $('#nextQuestion').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!picked)return;if(currentQuestion<activeQuiz.questions.length-1){currentQuestion++;picked=false;renderQuestion()}else finishQuiz()});
}
function chooseAnswer(index){if(picked)return;picked=true;const q=activeQuiz.questions[currentQuestion];const correct=index===q.answer;if(correct)quizScore++;$$('.quiz-option').forEach((b,i)=>{b.disabled=true;if(i===q.answer)b.classList.add('selected')});$('#feedback').innerHTML=`<p class="quiz-feedback" style="color:${correct?'#7de3c0':'#ffbf8a'}">${correct?'Correct!':'Not quite.'} ${q.explain}</p>`;$('#nextQuestion').disabled=false}
function finishQuiz(autoSubmitted=false){if(quizSubmitted)return;quizSubmitted=true;stopQuizTimer();trackStudyEvent('quiz');const points=quizScore*10;const old=Number(localStorage.getItem('studyspark_points')||0);localStorage.setItem('studyspark_points',String(old+points));showModal(`<div class="eyebrow">${autoSubmitted?'TIME EXPIRED · TEST AUTO-SUBMITTED':'SESSION COMPLETE'}</div><h2 id="modalTitle">${autoSubmitted?'Time is up. Your test has been submitted.':'Nice work. Keep going!'}</h2><p>You scored <strong style="color:#c5b0ff">${quizScore} / ${activeQuiz.questions.length}</strong> and earned <strong style="color:#82c9ff">${points} demo points</strong>.</p><div class="admin-item">Your score is saved only in this browser. To create a real shared leaderboard, connect a database and secure user accounts.</div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="doneQuiz" style="width:100%">Back to StudySpark →</button>`);$('#doneQuiz').addEventListener('click',()=>{closeModal();renderLeaderboard();toast('Demo score saved on this device.')})}
function renderLeaderboard(){const p=getProfile();if(!p)return;const points=Number(localStorage.getItem('studyspark_points')||0);const rows=[{name:p.name,subtitle:'Your demo profile',points,initial:p.name[0]?.toUpperCase()||'Y',own:true},{name:'Aarav',subtitle:'Maths explorer',points:280,initial:'A'},{name:'Meera',subtitle:'Science thinker',points:250,initial:'M'},{name:'Rohan',subtitle:'History learner',points:210,initial:'R'}].sort((a,b)=>b.points-a.points).slice(0,4);$('#leaderRows').innerHTML=rows.map((r,i)=>`<div class="leader-row"><span class="rank">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="leader-avatar ${i===0?'lavender':i===1?'blue':i===2?'orange':'lavender'}">${r.initial}</span><span class="leader-name"><b>${escapeHTML(r.name)}${r.own?' (you)':''}</b><small>${r.subtitle}</small></span><strong>${r.points} <small>pts</small></strong></div>`).join('')}
function escapeHTML(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]))}
$('#viewLeaderboard').addEventListener('click',()=>{renderLeaderboard();$('#leaderRows').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});toast('Showing sample leaderboard plus your local demo score.')});
